Per-install certificates of the ISDS accounts and of the older data-box client, named by cert and key in
misc/datovka/datovka_conf.php (see datovka_conf.php.default there); a relative path starts here. The
directory is versioned only through this file: git does not keep empty directories, and the certificates
themselves are per-install and ignored.

This directory lies in the tree the web server serves, and some servers ignore .htaccess. A file that
holds a private key belongs outside the directory of AA, named by a full path; kept here, only its owner
may read it (chmod 600) - State Check reports one the group or others may read.
